%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4b3f2a8c8f344355b16a4d4296ae3f98, type: 3}
  m_Name: Grizzly
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  vesselClass: 5
  entries:
  - Element: 3
    AbilityLabel: Charged Cannon
    AbilityDescription: Hold to charge, release to fire - bigger charge, bigger boom.
      Space grows the explosion radius. At level 5 your blasts spare allies, so you
      can bombard freely near teammates (you still ride your own shockwaves).
    Input: 8
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Safe Detonation
    UpgradeDescription: Friendly fire off - your explosions no longer damage allied
      vessels or your own domain's prisms. Self-propulsion is unaffected.
  - Element: 2
    AbilityLabel: Weapon Systems
    AbilityDescription: Cycle your three weapons - explosives, sniper and the
      plasma claw. Mass is the claw's weight - its flame reaches 60 u at rest
      and 120 u at level 10, and lights 3 prisms a tick at rest, 8 at level 10.
      At level 5 the claw stops destroying what it burns and STEALS it for your
      team instead.
    Input: 14
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Claimed Fire
    UpgradeDescription: The plasma claw stops destroying what it burns - a prism
      that burns out now joins your domain instead, converting enemy volume into
      your own. The claw itself is available from the start.
  - Element: 1
    AbilityLabel: Dig In
    AbilityDescription: Stop to dig in and BRACE - while planted, energy regenerates
      and the charged cannon winds up faster, x2 at rest and x5 at level 10. Dig
      in, wind up, bombard, rush out. Level 5 grants battlefield sight while dug
      in.
    Input: 6
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Battle Sight
    UpgradeDescription: While dug in, every rival vessel within range is marked
      in its own domain colour, through mass.
  - Element: 4
    AbilityLabel: Rush
    AbilityDescription: Spend energy to RAM forward - for the length of the burst
      the hull smashes every rival prism it ploughs into (plain and shielded;
      super-shielded mass holds). Time refills a spent rush faster, 6 s at rest
      and 2.5 s at level 10. At level 5 the ram follows your nose.
    Input: 7
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Vector Control
    UpgradeDescription: The ram follows your nose - turn mid-rush and the charge
      turns with you, carving a curved swathe instead of a straight one.
